=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI00bG9BRpaMLK0aVg4sgTauYu5JV-JT3dHFPrJbepFzQ&oe=6AB2A288"}, "display_name": "Horror Mansion - Elanor's Villa", "keywords": ["Horror", "Escape", "Scary", "Nightmare", "Villa"], "long_description": "Horror Mansion - Elanor's Villa\n\nSomething is wrong with the old villa.\n\nFor years, locals have reported strange noises, unexplained disappearances, and sightings of a mysterious woman wandering the halls after dark. Most who enter never stay long enough to discover the truth.\n\nAs an investigator, you must explore the abandoned mansion, search for hidden clues, unlock forgotten areas, and uncover the dark secrets buried within its walls.\n\nBut you are not alone.\n\nA presence watches your every move. Whispers echo through empty corridors. Doors open on their own. Shadows move where no one should be.\n\nThe deeper you venture into the villa, the closer you come to discovering the truth behind Eleanor and the curse that binds her to this place.\n\nWill you find the courage to continue... or become another lost soul trapped within the mansion?\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Immersive VR horror experience\n\u2022 Explore a mysterious haunted mansion\n\u2022 Solve environmental puzzles and uncover secrets\n\u2022 Search for hidden ritual fragments\n\u2022 Atmospheric sound design and paranormal events\n\u2022 Intense jump scares and psychological horror moments\n\u2022 Story-driven investigation experience\n\u2022 Designed exclusively for Virtual Reality\n\nWarning\n\nThis game contains intense horror, jump scares, flashing lights, disturbing imagery, and loud sounds. Player discretion is advised.\n\nEnter the villa if you dare. Eleanor is waiting. \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f", "short_description": "Explore a haunted villa, uncover hidden secrets, and survive terrifying encounters as you search for the truth behind Eleanor's restless spirit."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_poli